<%- layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container info-page">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

    <hr>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>What is WonderLust?</h4>
        <p>
            WonderLust is a platform where you can discover and share
            amazing accommodation listings.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>Is WonderLust free to use?</h4>
        <p>
            Yes, you can explore listings and use the basic features
            of WonderLust.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>How can I create a listing?</h4>
        <p>
            You can create a listing by using the Add New Listing option.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>Can I edit my listing?</h4>
        <p>
            Yes, you can edit your listing anytime using the Edit option.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>How can I contact support?</h4>
        <p>
            You can visit the Contact Us page to get in touch with us.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>